      "title": "jtckdint: Cast to prevent MSVC (C4244) shortening errors",
      "message": "jtckdint: Cast to prevent MSVC (C4244) shortening errors\n\nExplicitly cast the result to prevent MSVC from warning about\npossible shortening from implicit casts.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-04-30T11:54:51.000-04:00",
